IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TRNLIM01.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-BASE-LIMIT       PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0005000.00.
01 WS-RISK-SCORE       PIC 9(3)     VALUE 000.
01 WS-FINAL-LIMIT      PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0000000.00.
01 WS-GRANDFATHERED    PIC X        VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    PERFORM LOAD-POLICY
    PERFORM LOAD-CUSTOMER-RISK
    PERFORM APPLY-EXCEPTION
    PERFORM CALCULATE-LIMIT
    GOBACK.
LOAD-POLICY.
    CALL 'LIMITPOL'.
LOAD-CUSTOMER-RISK.
    CALL 'CUSTRSK'.
APPLY-EXCEPTION.
    IF WS-GRANDFATHERED = 'Y'
       MOVE WS-BASE-LIMIT TO WS-FINAL-LIMIT
    END-IF.
CALCULATE-LIMIT.
    IF WS-GRANDFATHERED NOT = 'Y'
       IF WS-RISK-SCORE > 800
          COMPUTE WS-FINAL-LIMIT = WS-BASE-LIMIT * 1.20
       ELSE
          MOVE WS-BASE-LIMIT TO WS-FINAL-LIMIT
       END-IF
    END-IF.
